[gd_scene format=3]

; The cannon: carried out of sight, used by its own key (N, use_key) wherever it is carried, or
; select it and press the use button (use: a press). Each use launches a new cannon ball, at most
; one every 1.2 s:
;   Cannon   CbItem     says cannon.fired (the look's boom)
;     Fire   CbLaunch   a new cannon.ball (prefabs/ball.tscn) where the camera looks, at 36 m/s
;                       with 1 m/s of lift and the shooter's own velocity, from 0.9 m ahead; it is
;                       gone again after 10 s
; What a ball does when it hits is the cannon mod's (cannon.cpp): a hole in a wall that breaks, a
; hurt to a player. Saving this scene bakes it into res://items/cannon.cannon.cfg.

